  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IUCN - Capacity Building for the Plastics Treaty in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will empower selected governments and their stakeholders in Africa to inform negotiations for the Global Plastics Treaty, whose measures are responsive to the needs and circumstances of developing countries. Target countries: Carbo Verde, Guinea-Bissau, Sao Tome e Principe, Senegal, and Sierral Leone.</narrative>
  </description>
